<div id="2026-10-30-occurrence-day-lock" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-10-30 — Stop and Done lock the day</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Stop or Done on a recurring calendar block writes a log for that date. The block stays on later days. The day view shows it as done only on the locked date.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Closing the todo removed the drink from every future day, and the embed had no working Done control.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Util/TodoLog.pm</code>, <code>Controller/Todo.pm</code>, <code>Controller/Api.pm</code>, <code>root/todo/day.tt</code>.</p>
</div>
